1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
What’s new in Island Time 1.25.1, shown with mock game data.

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Send feedback now has a Send button: your note goes straight to the developer.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:13,500
No GitHub account needed. Add your email if you’d like a reply. It’s in Settings and on the end screen.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,000
New versions now go to testers first, on a beta page of their own.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,500
The beta keeps its own saved games, so trying it never touches your real ones.

6
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Play free in your browser at krazow.github.io/islandtime

